    <bpmn:process id="W_W3898" name="W3898. B2B / Trade &amp; Key-Account Profile Enrichment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Account need; key-account cycle (links to VS-107)
Frequency: Continuous + periodic refresh
Volume: ~5,200 trade + ~200 corporate accounts
Owner: CDP / Trade
Participants: CDP Team, Trade Sales (links to VS-11), Key Account (links to VS-107), Trade Credit/AR (links to VS-16/VS-68), KYC (links to VS-86), Project/Design (links to VS-66), Insights (links to VS-28.1), Privacy (links to VS-91)
Source: workflow W3898 — B2B / Trade &amp; Key-Account Profile Enrichment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3898_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3898_Lane1" name="CDP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3898_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3898_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3898_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3898_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3898_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3898_Start3" name="Account need; key-account cycle (links to VS-107)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3898_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3898_Task4" name="CDP/Trade build the B2B/customer 360: firmographic (SEC/DTI/BIR/industry/size)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CDP/Trade build the B2B/customer 360: firmographic (SEC/DTI/BIR/industry/size), relationship hierarchy (links to VS-107 account hierarchy), contract/pricing (links to VS-11.1/W163), credit/AR exposure (links to VS-16/VS-68), project history (links to VS-11/VS-66), and contacts/decision-makers
Responsible (R): CDP / Trade / Key Account
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Per account + periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3898_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3898_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3898_Task5" name="CDP/Trade enrich with behavior: spend/share-of-wallet, category-mix, attach…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CDP/Trade enrich with behavior: spend/share-of-wallet, category-mix, attach (links to VS-124), service usage (links to VS-09/VS-12), competitiveness (links to VS-57), and growth/CLV (links to W3894)
Responsible (R): CDP / Trade / Insights
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3898_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3898_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3898_Task6" name="CDP/Privacy/KYC ensure B2B data is consented/KYB-verified (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CDP/Privacy/KYC ensure B2B data is consented/KYB-verified (links to VS-86/VS-91), govern B2B contact data under RA 10173 and anti-spam rules, and feed account teams via CRM/360 (links to VS-107/W3897)
Responsible (R): CDP / Privacy / KYC / Trade
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3898_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3898_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3898_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3898_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3898_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-609 (ensure controlled execution — Customer 360 Consumption, Privacy &amp; Governance Analytics (PA-126.3).) | - operational: hierarchy governance; operational: B2B consent/KYB (links to VS-91/VS-86)
Owner: CDP / Trade</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3898_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3898_Annotation8" targetRef="W3898_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
