    <bpmn:process id="W_W3899" name="W3899. Loyalty Program Data &amp; Tier/Behavior Enrichment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Loyalty cycle (links to VS-13); tier evaluation
Frequency: Continuous + tier cycle
Volume: ~600,000 loyalty members
Owner: CDP / Loyalty
Participants: CDP Team, Loyalty (links to VS-13), Marketing (links to VS-14), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Insights (links to VS-28.1), Data Science (links to VS-30.2), Privacy (links to VS-91), Mobile App (links to VS-75)
Source: workflow W3899 — Loyalty Program Data &amp; Tier/Behavior Enrichment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3899_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3899_Lane1" name="CDP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3899_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3899_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3899_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3899_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3899_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3899_Start3" name="Loyalty cycle (links to VS-13); tier evaluation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3899_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3899_Task4" name="CDP/Loyalty enrich the profile with loyalty data: tier/status…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CDP/Loyalty enrich the profile with loyalty data: tier/status (Bronze/Silver/Gold/Platinum), points balance/history, redemption behavior, category-affinity, channel-mix, and engagement (app links to VS-75, email/SMS) — sourced from the loyalty engine (links to VS-13.2)
Responsible (R): CDP / Loyalty / Data Engineering
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3899_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3899_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3899_Task5" name="CDP/Loyalty support tier evaluation/upgrade (links to VS-13)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CDP/Loyalty support tier evaluation/upgrade (links to VS-13), soft-landing/downgrade, and lifecycle communication (links to W3893), with the tier written to the profile (links to W3884) and exposed at POS (links to VS-08/VS-124)
Responsible (R): CDP / Loyalty / Marketing
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3899_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3899_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3899_Task6" name="CDP/Insights measure loyalty economics (lift vs non-member, tier value…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CDP/Insights measure loyalty economics (lift vs non-member, tier value, redemption rate, breakage links to VS-54/VS-17) and feed loyalty-strategy decisions (links to VS-13) and CLV (links to W3894)
Responsible (R): CDP / Insights / Loyalty / Finance
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3899_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3899_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3899_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3899_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3899_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-609 (ensure controlled execution — Customer 360 Consumption, Privacy &amp; Governance Analytics (PA-126.3).) | - operational: tier rules and review; operational: breakage accounting (links to VS-17)
Owner: CDP / Loyalty</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
