    <bpmn:process id="W_W3900" name="W3900. Data Subject Access Request (DSAR) &amp; Consumer Rights Workflow" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Consumer rights request (access/rectification/erasure/portability/objection)
Frequency: Continuous (RA 10173 rights; NPC-mandated timelines)
Volume: ~hundreds–thousands of DSARs/yr
Owner: CDP / Privacy
Participants: CDP Team, Privacy/DPO (links to VS-91), Legal (links to VS-100), Loyalty (links to VS-13), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), Trade (links to VS-11/VS-16), Contact Center (links to VS-13), IT (links to VS-27), Insights (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3900 — Data Subject Access Request (DSAR) &amp; Consumer Rights Workflow</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3900_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3900_Lane1" name="CDP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3900_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3900_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3900_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3900_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3900_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3900_Start3" name="Consumer rights request (access/rectification/erasure/portability/objection)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3900_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3900_Task4" name="CDP/Privacy receive and verify DSAR identity (links to VS-91), classify request…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CDP/Privacy receive and verify DSAR identity (links to VS-91), classify request type, and scope the data to be retrieved from the CDP golden record and downstream sources (POS links to VS-08, ecommerce links to VS-10, loyalty links to VS-13, trade links to VS-16)
Responsible (R): CDP / Privacy / Contact Center
Accountable (A): CDP Lead / DPO
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3900_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3900_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
