      <bpmn:userTask id="W3900_Task5" name="CDP fulfill within NPC-mandated timelines: access report (profile, segments…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CDP fulfill within NPC-mandated timelines: access report (profile, segments, consents, history), rectification (correct/profile update links to W3884), erasure/objection (suppress/delete per policy and legal-hold check links to VS-88/W3013), and portability (export)
Responsible (R): CDP / Privacy / IT
Accountable (A): CDP Lead / DPO
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3900_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3900_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3900_Task6" name="CDP/Privacy document the DSAR response, propagate erasure/suppression to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CDP/Privacy document the DSAR response, propagate erasure/suppression to downstream systems and activation channels (links to W3891), and maintain the audit trail for NPC (links to VS-91)
Responsible (R): CDP / Privacy / IT
Accountable (A): CDP Lead / DPO
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3900_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3900_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
