Volume: DPIA per high-risk processing; annual consent audit
Owner: CDP / Privacy
Participants: CDP Team, Privacy/DPO (links to VS-91), Legal (links to VS-100), IT Security (links to VS-27.3), Internal Audit (links to VS-21), Marketing (links to VS-14), Data Science (links to VS-30.2), EA (links to VS-113)
Source: workflow W3901 — Customer Data Privacy, Consent Audit &amp; DPIA</bpmn:documentation>
