    <bpmn:process id="W_W3902" name="W3902. Customer Data Retention, Archival &amp; Purge" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Retention cycle; legal-hold release (links to VS-88)
Frequency: Periodic + on trigger
Volume: ~600K–1M profiles + transaction history (7-yr BIR retention for financial records)
Owner: CDP / Data Governance
Participants: CDP Team, Data Governance (links to VS-29/VS-28.2), Privacy (links to VS-91), Legal (links to VS-100/VS-88), Finance/Tax (links to VS-79/VS-17), IT (links to VS-27), Insights (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3902 — Customer Data Retention, Archival &amp; Purge</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3902_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3902_Lane1" name="CDP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3902_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3902_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3902_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3902_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3902_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3902_Start3" name="Retention cycle; legal-hold release (links to VS-88)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3902_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3902_Task4" name="CDP/Data-Governance maintain the customer-data retention schedule by data class…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CDP/Data-Governance maintain the customer-data retention schedule by data class (transactional/financial 7-yr per BIR links to VS-79, marketing/behavioral per consent/shorter, PII per purpose — links to VS-91), with legal-hold exceptions (links to VS-88/W3013)
Responsible (R): CDP / Data Governance / Legal
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3902_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3902_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3902_Task5" name="CDP/IT archive aged data to tiered storage (links to VS-27.2 W396) and purge…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CDP/IT archive aged data to tiered storage (links to VS-27.2 W396) and purge expired non-financial customer data per schedule and DSAR erasure (links to W3900), with certificates of destruction
Responsible (R): CDP / IT / Privacy
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3902_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3902_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3902_Task6" name="CDP/Privacy/Legal verify retention compliance (links to VS-91), retain…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CDP/Privacy/Legal verify retention compliance (links to VS-91), retain financial/transactional records for BIR/tax (links to VS-79), and report retention metrics to the privacy committee
Responsible (R): CDP / Privacy / Legal / Tax
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3902_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3902_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3902_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3902_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
