    <bpmn:process id="W_W3903" name="W3903. Customer Analytics &amp; Insights Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Reporting cycle; strategy need
Frequency: Weekly/monthly/quarterly
Volume: ~30–60 standard customer reports/dashboards
Owner: CDP / Insights
Participants: CDP Team, Insights (links to VS-28.1), Marketing (links to VS-14), Loyalty (links to VS-13), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Trade (links to VS-11/VS-107), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Strategy (links to VS-33), Consumer Insights (links to VS-44)
Source: workflow W3903 — Customer Analytics &amp; Insights Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
