      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3903_Task4" name="CDP/Insights produce the customer analytics suite: acquisition/retention/churn…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CDP/Insights produce the customer analytics suite: acquisition/retention/churn (links to W3894), CLV distribution, segment performance, channel-mix, loyalty economics (links to W3899), trade-account growth (links to VS-107), and category-affinity (links to VS-01)
Responsible (R): CDP / Insights
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Weekly/monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3903_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3903_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3903_Task5" name="CDP/Insights deliver self-service BI and ad-hoc analysis to functions (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CDP/Insights deliver self-service BI and ad-hoc analysis to functions (links to VS-28.1/W684), with governed access (links to VS-91/W3897) and data quality (links to W3886)
Responsible (R): CDP / Insights / Data Governance
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3903_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3903_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3903_Task6" name="CDP/Strategy/Insights feed customer insights into commercial decisions…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CDP/Strategy/Insights feed customer insights into commercial decisions (merchandising links to VS-01/VS-101, marketing links to VS-14, store/format links to VS-07/VS-109, strategy links to VS-33) and report to leadership
Responsible (R): CDP / Insights / Strategy
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3903_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3903_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
