    <bpmn:process id="W_W3904" name="W3904. CDP Value Realization, ROI &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual budget (links to VS-33.1); steering review
Frequency: Quarterly + annual
Volume: CDP program budget &amp; value scorecard
Owner: CDP / Finance
Participants: CDP Team, Finance (links to VS-17.4), Insights (links to VS-28.1), Marketing (links to VS-14), Loyalty (links to VS-13), Trade (links to VS-11/VS-107), Strategy (links to VS-33), Privacy (links to VS-91), IT/FinOps (links to VS-27.2)
Source: workflow W3904 — CDP Value Realization, ROI &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3904_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3904_Lane1" name="CDP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3904_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3904_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3904_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3904_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3904_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3904_Start3" name="Annual budget (links to VS-33.1); steering review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3904_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3904_Task4" name="CDP/Finance develop the CDP budget (platform, talent, vendor, activation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CDP/Finance develop the CDP budget (platform, talent, vendor, activation support) aligned to annual budget (links to VS-33.1/VS-17.4) and the value thesis (personalization lift, retention, efficiency)
Responsible (R): CDP / Finance
Accountable (A): CIO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3904_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3904_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3904_Task5" name="CDP/Insights measure CDP value: attributable incremental revenue/margin (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CDP/Insights measure CDP value: attributable incremental revenue/margin (links to W3896), retention/CLV uplift (links to W3894), marketing efficiency (links to W3895), and cost (platform/vendor/FinOps links to VS-27.2)
Responsible (R): CDP / Insights / Finance
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3904_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3904_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3904_Task6" name="CDP/Strategy run continuous improvement: reallocate spend to highest-value use…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CDP/Strategy run continuous improvement: reallocate spend to highest-value use cases, mature the platform (links to VS-113), and report value realization to the CDP steering and executive (links to W3881/VS-33)
Responsible (R): CDP / Strategy / Finance
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3904_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3904_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3904_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3904_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3904_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-609 (ensure controlled execution — Customer 360 Consumption, Privacy &amp; Governance Analytics (PA-126.3).) | - operational: attributable-value scorecard; operational: scope governance (links to VS-113)
Owner: CDP / Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
